  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simagui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simagui:p001:m0000" ref="8lv_2pn_v62">毗陵悼王軌</persName>，字正則，初拜騎都尉，年二歲而夭。太康十年，追加封諡，以<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simagui:p001:m0033" ref="20b_1c2_a06">楚王瑋</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simagui:p001:m0037" ref="8hq_3at_4ha">義</persName>嗣。</p>
